* Synthetic Cargo-24 normalizer-style incumbent contract.
* The selector-only assignment x2=true is intentionally invalid unless the
* copy/objective bits x5 and x8 are also materialized.
* #variable= 8 #constraint= 8
min: +1 x7 +2 x8 ;
+1 ~x1 >= 1 ;
+1 x1 +1 x2 +1 x3 = 1 ;
+1 x1 -1 x4 = 0 ;
+1 x2 -1 x5 = 0 ;
+1 x3 -1 x6 = 0 ;
+1 x4 +1 x5 +1 x6 = 1 ;
+1 x7 -1 x4 -1 x6 = 0 ;
+1 x8 -1 x5 = 0 ;
